  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support measures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Support Measures will contribute to the implementation of the EU&#xbf;s strategic priorities in Bhutan. Activities financed under this Action may include: i) supporting the Royal Government of Bhutan&apos;s reforms in priority areas identified in the MIP 2021-2027; ii) assisting in the preparation, follow-up, monitoring, and evaluation of EU-funded initiatives; iii) carrying out ad hoc activities such as studies, events, training and Team Europe joint activities.</narrative>
  </description>
